# St generate/compile deny list.
#
# Every entry needs a reason and permanence:
#   TEMPORARY — corridor/mock stand-in; undeny + wire when that work lands
#   PERMANENT — hand override owns the body, GIR/Vala/ABI clash, or
#               non-marshallable; not deferred RPC
# Prefer TEMPORARY unless the symbol will not later become a generated stub.
#
# ************************************************************************
# TEMPORARY — revisit / undeny when implementing (keep this block together)
# ************************************************************************

# ************************************************************************
# PERMANENT — not deferred RPC work
# ************************************************************************

# PERMANENT — client stub does not implement these GIR interfaces.
Atk.ImplementorIface
Atk.Component
Atk.Value
Gio.Icon
Gio.LoadableIcon
Clutter.Content

# Opaque GIR privates — clash with Vala GObject instance private + rpc_lid.
IconPrivate
LabelPrivate
WidgetPrivate
ThemeNodePrivate
ThemeContextPrivate

# No GIR ctor — Actor parent-walk mints Helper-Actor.create / St-*.new.
Widget.new

# Adjustment.override — GIR ctor needs actor + six doubles; mint with zeros.
# Transitions stay client-owned (Clutter.Transition not always leased).
Adjustment.new
Adjustment.add_transition
Adjustment.remove_transition
Adjustment.get_transition

# GLib.Icon not on object wire — Icon.override via Helper-Icon string form.
Icon.gicon
Icon.get_gicon
Icon.set_gicon
Icon.fallback_gicon
Icon.get_fallback_gicon
Icon.set_fallback_gicon

# Client-owned theme files for loadTheme (Theme.override.vala).
Theme.new
Theme.application_stylesheet
Theme.default_stylesheet
Theme.theme_stylesheet
Theme.get_application_stylesheet
Theme.get_default_stylesheet
Theme.get_theme_stylesheet
Theme.load_stylesheet
Theme.unload_stylesheet
# Client-owned Gio.File list; URIs already on Helper-ThemeContext.set_theme.
Theme.get_custom_stylesheets

# IconTheme.override — int[] via Bytes/ay int32 slab (StreamValue BOXED).
IconTheme.get_icon_sizes

# ImageContent.override — mint + pixmap memfd on Request.buffer (not ay).
ImageContent.new_with_preferred_size
ImageContent.set_data

# FocusManager.override — pack type/keyval/state; Helper rebuilds key event.
FocusManager.navigate_from_event

# Class singleton getters — hand overrides.
ThemeContext.get_for_stage
ThemeContext.get_theme
ThemeContext.set_theme
FocusManager.get_for_stage
Settings.get

# Client-owned a11y proxy — GenericAccessible.override.vala (BarLevel/Slider).
GenericAccessible.new_for_actor

# ScrollView.override — child + policies (construct timing / local store).
ScrollView.child
ScrollView.get_child
ScrollView.set_child
ScrollView.hscrollbar_policy
ScrollView.vscrollbar_policy

# Entry.override — subscribe text-changed (and key signals) on the inner
# Clutter.Text after the lease exists. Generated getter is RPC only.
Entry.clutter_text
Entry.get_clutter_text

# DrawingArea.override — cairo.Context is not marshallable. Local
# ImageSurface for GJS repaint handlers (stock is only valid during that
# emission).
DrawingArea.get_context

# GIR factory named `new` (returns Clutter.Content) — Vala C symbol clash.
SpinnerContent.new
